    "updated_at": "2024-03-14T06:23:09Z",
    "body": "This has since become more correct:\r\n\r\n> If handler is a [Function](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#common-Function), then [invoke](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invoke-a-callback-function) handler given arguments with the [callback this value](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-callback-this-value) set to thisArg. If this throws an exception, catch it, and [report the exception](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#report-the-exception).",
